# Line endings are a checkout policy, not content — and docdog's content
# hashes are its cache keys (DD-051, PROPOSAL-029). Without this, a worktree
# checked out under core.autocrlf=true holds CRLF where the tree it was cut
# from holds LF: same record, different bytes, different hash.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.onnx binary
*.db binary

